OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 29 MAR
OL,4,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,5,     GCerys complements the festival by
OL,6,     Glooking at the city's canals with
OL,7,     GDr Keith Hendry and the rise of
OL,8,     Gclimbing with James Lister from
OL,9,     GThe Climbing Depot.
OL,10,G1300FGuy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,11,     GGuy looks back at the Manchester
OL,12,     Gmusic scene of the late 90s and
OL,13,     Gearly 2000s, which revolved
OL,14,     Garound the chippy-turned-music
OL,15,     Gvenue the Night and Day Cafe.
OL,16,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,17,     GIggy serves up his last sonic
OL,18,     Gcocktail of 2026 including loads
OL,19,     Gof show favourites. Expect key
OL,20,     Gcuts by the likes of Sleaford
OL,21,     GMods, Mediaeval Baebes, Albert
OL,22,     GAyler, Miles and more.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
